OL,3,AKate visits cancer patients in hospital
OL,4,Ashe helped fund with climb
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine, Princess of Wales has
OL,7,Fvisited the hospital where she was
OL,8,Ftreated for cancer after completing a
OL,9,Fcharity climb earlier this year to help
OL,10,Ffund a new unit there.
OL,12,F"This was my small way of being able to
OL,13,Fgive back and say thank you," Catherine
OL,14,Ftold staff at the Royal Marsden in
OL,15,FLondon on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
