OL,3,AKate visits cancer patients in hospital
OL,4,Ashe helped fund with climb
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe princess, who revealed two years
OL,7,Fago that she was receiving cancer
OL,8,Ftreatment, carried out the Three Peaks
OL,9,FChallenge in aid of the hospital, which
OL,10,Finvolved climbing the highest peaks in
OL,11,FEngland, Scotland and Wales within 24
OL,12,Fhours.
OL,14,FThe amount of money she raised has not
OL,15,Fbeen made public, but it will go
OL,16,Ftowards a new unit offering
OL,17,Fcomplementary healing alongside
OL,18,Fclinical care.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
